[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いよいよ本番かあ……キンチョーしてきた……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is really happening... I'm actually nervous..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんたも緊張とかするのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't tell me you get stage fright too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だって、こんな大勢の人の前に出るなんて\n初めてだし……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, yeah! I've never performed in front of this many people before..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういうときは、観客を別の何かだと思えばよい。\n野菜や果物……そうだ！\u3000ハンマーでもよいぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When that happens, imagine the audience as something else. Vegetables, fruit... oh! Hammers work well too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "見渡す限りのハンマー……！\nなんかいける気がしてきた！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A sea of hammers...! Okay, I think I can actually do this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ま、あんたがいいならいいけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Whatever works for you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううう……私たちが用意した舞台装置、\nちゃんと動いてくれますように……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ohhh... please, please let the stage setup we built work properly..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは、レスナちゃんが一番緊張してるかも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha, I think Resna might be the most nervous one here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう思う気持ちも分かりますが……\n「お祭り」なのですから、楽しまなくては損ですわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I understand the feeling, but... this is a festival. You'd be doing yourself a disservice not to enjoy it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "『Ｃｕｔｉｅ☆ＡｎｉｍａＬ』さん、\nスタンバイお願いします！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cutie☆AnimalL, please head to your positions!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スタッフ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "スタッフ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "見てて、レスナちゃん。緊張が吹き飛んじゃうくらい\n楽しいライブにするから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Watch us, Resna. We're going to put on a show so fun it'll blow your nerves away!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "期待には必ず応えてみせるわ。私にとって、\nこれが世界一のアイドルへの第一歩になるんだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We won't let you down. For me, this is the first step toward becoming the world's greatest idol."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "見る者すべてが「あっ」と驚くような、\n最高のステージを作り上げてみせまする！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We shall deliver a performance that leaves every last soul in that crowd speechless!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頑張ってね、みんな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good luck, everyone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたたちの歌と踊りで、\n観客を沸かせてみせなさい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Go out there and set that audience ablaze with your singing and dancing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では、参ろうか！\u3000一世一代の大勝負に！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then let us go! To the performance of a lifetime!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いつも通りやるだけよ。\nだって、私はいつも完璧なんだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll just do what I always do. Because I'm always perfect."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "目いっぱい盛り上げていこー！\u3000おー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's get this crowd going! Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "コンコン！\u3000貴殿の心にお邪魔しまする！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Knock knock! Coming to you live!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
